> - 条件类：标记移行绘条纹(marker_drop_stripes), 压缩到标记旁(compress_to_adjacent_marker), 翻转后拼接(flip_append), 从平行行列推断(infer_from_parallel), 按面积降序(largest_to_smallest_area), 分隔色填充间隙(sep_color_fills_gap), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 按边界框内外分色(color_by_bounding_box_membership), 补对角线边(fill_diagonal_side), 穿透或停靠(pass_through_or_stop), 标记色决定填充(marker_color_sets_fill), 追加封盖层(cap_layer_added), 布尔并集合并(boolean_union), 对角空位补块(complement_at_diagonal_vacancies), 唯一图案选取(unique_pattern_selected), 异常值选择(outlier_selection), 密集带检测(dense_band_detection), 面积区分角色(area_determines_role), 指引色映射象限(guide_maps_quadrant), 各副本互补缺失(copies_complement), 端点编码位移(endpoints_encode_disp), 相位编码(phase_encoding), 按列周期取色(column_modular_phase)
